===Etymology 2===
From {{prefix|en|grave}}.

====Verb====
{{en-verb|engrav|es}}

# {{obsolete}} To put in a [[grave]], to [[bury]].
#* '''1590''', Edmund Spenser, ''The Faerie Queene'', II.i:
#*: So both agree their bodies to '''engraue'''; / The great earthes wombe they open to the sky [...].

